scenario: POWER-01
title: Sleep, power card and profiles
area: Power
rows: F-PWR-01, F-KBD-05, F-KBD-16
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Save any open work.
step: Press the power key briefly.
expect: A card offers Power off, Restart, Sleep and Cancel.
clause: F-KBD-05.card
step: Choose Sleep, wait until the screen is dark, then press a key.
expect: The computer wakes within ten seconds and asks for the password if the lock is on.
clause: F-KBD-16.sleep
step: Open Settings, System, Power and choose a different power profile.
expect: The page says the profile is active and the computer stays responsive.
clause: F-PWR-01.profile
step: Choose Restart from the power card.
expect: The computer restarts and comes back to the sign-in screen.
clause: F-KBD-05.restart
